  m_Name: Cap3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Right Rear Cap
  description: The Right Rear Cap is a small but critical component located at the
    middle-center-rear of the jet engine, providing a secure and stable mounting
    point for the engine's shaft. Made from a high-strength material such as Shaft1
    2, it helps to transmit power to the turbine and maintain the engine's structural
    integrity. The Right Rear Cap's design is carefully calibrated to work in tandem
    with other caps and components to ensure optimal engine performance.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 414bd11c780775d48bc4c74efb2c3871, type: 3}
